WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:10.200
In a project, go down to its tasks

2
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.700
Open the task

3
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:19.500
Pull the sheet up to Subtasks

4
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:23.700
Under Subtasks, type a step

5
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:29.400
Return adds it

6
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:34.600
Tick a step off when it's done

7
00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:39.400
The task counts them: 1 of 3 done

8
00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:43.000
Back in the project…

9
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:52.500
…the task's row shows the count too
